# BRINGUP #11 (open): movie frames display duplicated (stacked twice with black bands) and the
# first ~4 s show only the lower half. Screenshots over the star-field and opening FMV.
# Expect while #11 is open: k2-frame-003600.png (star-field) and k2-frame-004800.png (opening
# FMV) show the picture pushed into the lower part of the screen under a black band.
# Run: K2_PROBE=probes/bringup-11-movie-display.probe kessen2 --headless --frames 5000
k2probe 1
watch 0x1113320:4 every=600          # movie frame counter (which movie frame is on screen)
screenshot every=600 from=1200
